  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Infiltration sphere, Scoundrel sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you succeed at a dirty trick or steal combat maneuver against a creature, you may apply a (sabotage) talent to the creature or its equipment in place of a (trick) talent. You may choose to delay the effects of your dirty trick until after the sabotage triggers or ends.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/champion-feats#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
